{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A song of ascents.</b> Like the sense above, concerning the children: <b>Happy is everyone who fears YHWH</b> — that he not commit a prohibition out of fear of HaShem." "<b>Who walks in His ways</b> — in the ways of HaShem, which are positive commandments."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 128, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:22.452803902Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}